414
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:33,010
that you've already written to

415
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:36,265
access specific points
within the circular buffer.

416
00:17:36,265 --> 00:17:39,220
We've implemented
in Assignment 7 in

417
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,510
a way that's going
