424
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:57,730
A little bit more about

425
00:17:57,730 --> 00:18:00,685
what to return from your
aesd_read function,

426
00:18:00,685 --> 00:18:04,060
if you return the value
that equals the count,

427
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:05,680
you're telling user space that

428
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:08,665
