mutex wait for instance,

453
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:13,300
and -EINTR for other cases

454
00:19:13,300 --> 00:19:14,470
where you need to handle

455
00:19:14,470 --> 00:19:17,110
interrupts or -EFAULT
